      "text": "sons of Lehi1 are obliged to leave behind property with Laban, 1 Ne. 3:26. they that are left in Zion shall be called holy, 2 Ne. 14:3 (Isa. 4:3). priests left labors to preach, and people left labors to hear, Alma 1:26. those called according to God’s foreknowledge are left to choose good or evil, Alma 13:3. day of the Lord will leave wicked neither root nor branch, 3 Ne. 25:1 (Mal. 4:1). Nephites are left to themselves, that the Spirit does not abide in them, Morm. 2:26.",
